{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"他承认自己仍怕代价、尚未想透，却继续行动，没有新增前史或外部事件，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对努力意义的心理调整，具体表达了他不再要求每次付出都证明自己能够改变一切。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"他把前文已经明确的亲近生活纳入保护对象，并以此支撑继续承担，没有新增具体人物关系或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"他因想到代价而发虚、却不撤回决定，给出了心理原因；「脚下短暂没把握」可理解为心理比喻，并未明确写成地面真的倾斜。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-6已经说明他知道不行动护不住珍惜之物，所以即使害怕仍接下眼前的事，能够解释本段继续行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-2说明行动能使他重新动起来却不能消除牵挂，足以限制他把每次付出都当成改变一切的证明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4已经明确他既想保护珍惜之物，也想保住亲近的生活，因此将后者纳入保护对象是对已有认识的聚焦和改写。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他带着代价顾虑继续行动，逐渐放下对付出效果的过高要求，把亲近生活纳入保护目标，并在短暂发虚时仍不撤回决定。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S12-1\",\n        \"S12-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"S12-1重复了S11-6已经说过的「怕代价仍接下眼前的事」，S12-4又重复「怕代价但仍继续」；S12-4新增的短暂摇晃主要是为了对应B3，且「脚下短暂没把握」略显生硬，可以把必要的犹疑并入S12-1而不必另立一条。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "14019a1a-c0f6-4135-9a76-7df80ce23c3c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T102114323408Z", "elapsed_seconds": 350.594, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:27:04.914946+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c6998060900c83f940ad67bb992fe61a2903891adc370b53144e2e7196dec0d8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T102114323408Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "62dd1f98c88624409e3e7d31f7bd7da5336147e9f078e50ebc87d6dfb5c9bb38"}}}
